# Paths the Entire Brain seed and code-index gates must not treat as source.
# Both the repository-context seed and the Graph code index honour this file
# on top of .gitignore.
#
# .claude/settings.local.json is written by `entire enable` / `entire graph setup`
# (the SubagentStart hook). It is local tool state, never source, and leaving it
# untracked made the brain refuse to build repository context from a "dirty"
# worktree.
#
# No leading slash: the Brain matcher compares the pattern against the git
# path (".claude/settings.local.json"), and a rooted pattern never matches.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Validation-suite scratch output under scripts/entire/ and the repo root.
# Same rationale as .claude/settings.local.json above: local run artefacts,
# never source, and untracked scratch made the brain treat the worktree as
# dirty and refuse to build repository context.
*.out

# A stray zero-byte file named 746 that some earlier run left in the repo
# root. Provenance was never established, so it is ignored rather than
# deleted - see artifact-stray-746-provenance.md.
746
